# One line ending everywhere. Four scripts carry a shebang, and a CRLF after `#!` makes
# the kernel look for an interpreter called "node" -- so this is correctness on Linux and
# macOS, not cosmetics. The vendored .wasm and the viewer templates are declared binary so
# no tool ever rewrites bytes inside them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.wasm binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
